  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <h3>Is COREWEAVER a search ranking algorithm?</h3>
  <p>No. COREWEAVER is a working name for an information and publishing method. It is not a claim to reproduce Google’s ranking systems or to control the outputs of language models.</p>
  <h3>How does this reduce hallucinations?</h3>
  <p>It cannot eliminate hallucinations. It reduces avoidable ambiguity by attaching claims to sources, definitions, relationships, dates, and verification steps so downstream systems have better evidence to retrieve.</p>
